{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Discord-style session-resume client. Runs as an actor so callers don’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have to worry about thread-safety; you can poke it from your transport"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"task and from the main actor freely."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionCoordinator"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":1,"type":"heading","text":"Architecture","anchor":"Architecture"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The coordinator owns three pieces of state:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The in-memory ","type":"text"},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (handshaking \/ replaying \/ live \/ disconnected).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A persistent "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(sessionId, lastSeq)"},{"type":"text","text":" cursor in "},{"code":"SessionStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A heartbeat timer that fires while the connection is healthy."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It does ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"text":" own the connection itself — that’s your transport’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"problem. The coordinator just decides what to send when you tell it"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"“the connection is open” or “I received this frame”."}]},{"anchor":"Lifecycle-the-seven-calls-youll-make","text":"Lifecycle (the seven calls you’ll make)","level":1,"type":"heading"},{"code":["\/\/ 1. On WebSocket c